{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50855","headline":"题朝阳洞 · 李当","name":"题朝阳洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上朝阳洞，无人肯暂过。\n今来惬心赏，回首恋烟萝。\n（见《八琼室金石补正》。\n）（〖1〗石刻於诗题下署「义阳守李当」五字。\n余说详魏深诗按语。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}